          "type": "json",
          "value": "[{\"q\": \"What is the capacity of the Travel Coffee Tumbler TT-400?\", \"a\": \"The Travel Coffee Tumbler TT-400 holds 400 ml.\"}, {\"q\": \"What material is the Travel Coffee Tumbler made from?\", \"a\": \"It is made of double-wall vacuum-insulated 18/8 stainless steel.\"}, {\"q\": \"Does the tumbler affect the taste of coffee?\", \"a\": \"No, the ceramic-coated interior ensures coffee keeps its taste.\"}, {\"q\": \"What kind of lid does the tumbler have?\", \"a\": \"It has a natural bamboo lid with a slide closure.\"}, {\"q\": \"How long does the tumbler keep drinks hot or cold?\", \"a\": \"It keeps coffee hot for 6 hours and drinks cold for 12 hours.\"}, {\"q\": \"Does the tumbler fit in car cup holders?\", \"a\": \"Yes, it fits most car cup holders.\"}, {\"q\": \"How should I clean the Travel Coffee Tumbler?\", \"a\": \"It is hand-wash only.\"}, {\"q\": \"How much does the Travel Coffee Tumbler cost?\", \"a\": \"The tumbler costs 26 USD.\"}, {\"q\": \"Are stainless steel tumblers good for coffee?\", \"a\": \"Yes, this stainless steel tumbler has a ceramic-coated interior so coffee keeps its taste and vacuum insulation to maintain temperature.\"}]"
